cription":"Yugabyte SQL (YSQL)"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2077017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider","html_url":"https://github.com/frozenspider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2077017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider","html_url":"https://github.com/frozenspider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2022-05-18T20:18:14Z","updated_at":"2022-09-20T06:20:05Z","closed_at":"2022-05-24T10:56:25Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-422](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-422)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nCurrently, different bits of our code disagrees on the default YSQL/pggate port:\r\n```cpp\r\nstruct PgProcessConf {\r\n  static constexpr uint16_t kDefaultPort = 5433;\r\n\r\n...\r\n\r\nclass PggateOptions : public yb::server::ServerBaseOptions {\r\n public:\r\n  static const uint16_t kDefaultPort = 5432;\r\n```\r\n\r\nThese defaults are used from two separate places:\r\n```cpp\r\n// Helper function to set the proxy rpc addresses based on rpc_bind_addresses.\r\nvoid SetProxyAddresses() {\r\n  LOG(INFO) << \"Using parsed rpc = \" << FLAGS_rpc_bind_addresses;\r\n  SetProxyAddress(&FLAGS_redis_proxy_bind_address, \"YEDIS\", RedisServer::kDefaultPort);\r\n  SetProxyAddress(&FLAGS_cql_proxy_bind_address, \"YCQL\", CQLServer::kDefaultPort);\r\n  SetProxyAddress(&FLAGS_pgsql_proxy_bind_address, \"YSQL\", PgProcessConf::kDefaultPort);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n```cpp\r\n  if (FLAGS_pggate_proxy_bind_address.empty()) {\r\n    HostPort host_port;\r\n    CHECK_OK(host_port.ParseString(FLAGS_rpc_bind_addresses, 0));\r\n    host_port.set_port(PggateOptions::kDefaultPort);\r\n    FLAGS_pggate_proxy_bind_address = host_port.ToString();\r\n    LOG(INFO) << \"Reset YSQL bind address to \" << FLAGS_pggate_proxy_bind_address;\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis leads to an issue when we actually resort to those defaults.\r\nOne such case is when `--pggate_proxy_bind_address` is unset on the tserver, so it resets to `rpc_bind_addresses` value.\r\nUsing YSQL upgrade, this leads to following:\r\n```\r\nI0517 18:23:37.347467 23377 tablet_server_main.cc:136] Reset YSQL bind address to <my-host>:5433\r\n...\r\nI0517 19:06:40.340145 28709 pggate.cc:161] Reset YSQL bind address to <my-host>:5432\r\n```\r\nalong with\r\n```\r\nI0517 18:06:31.213009 21128 tablet_service.cc:1606] YSQL upgrade failed: Network error (yb/yql/pgwrapper/libpq_utils.cc:184): Connect failed: could not connect to server: No such file or directory\r\nIs the server running locally and accepting\r\nconnections on Unix domain socket \"/tmp/.yb.15011221091750297222/.s.PGSQL.5433\"?, passed: 60.000s\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2077017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider","html_url":"https://github.com/frozenspider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12550/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12550/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}